BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.Localization.neighborhood_basin","signature":"∀ {E : Type u_1} [inst : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_1 : NormedSpace ℝ E] [inst_2 : FiniteDimensional ℝ E] {F : E → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (xStar : E),\n      (∀ (x : E), F xStar ≤ F x) →\n        (∀ (x : E), F x = F xStar → x = xStar) →\n          ∀ {U : Set E}, U ∈ nhds xStar → ∃ δ, 0 < δ ∧ {x | F x ≤ F xStar + δ} ⊆ U","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
