BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.ScalarHierarchy.NormalizedHierarchy.trace_pos","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {E : ℕ → ℕ → ℝ} {q δ : ℕ → ℝ} {K C : ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.ScalarHierarchy.NormalizedHierarchy n E q δ K C → ∀ (k : ℕ), 0 < E k 1","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
